  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C004.signal_basis",
    "value": "Recording relevant handling or handoff events and checking histories can yield an internally consistent sequence of participants and activities. Such continuity does not itself establish that responsibility actually transferred between people or that reports are truthful.",
    "scope": "The proposed onboarding histories, assuming the recording and inspection operations succeed and documentary continuity is observed.",
